    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 101,
        "Params": [
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/Bgstory289.png"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Red Tide Projection",
            "..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 72,
        "ActionId": 72,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "Who could have known how bad things could get?"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 73,
        "ActionId": 73,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "It didn't take a disaster, just some other Scavengers like us that we didn't watch out for. Then you were gone."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 74,
        "ActionId": 74,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 75,
        "ActionId": 75,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "Thank you, Bella."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 76,
        "ActionId": 76,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "I should have said that sooner."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 77,
        "ActionId": 77,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "You found me when I was completely lost, and you helped me along the way…"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 78,
        "ActionId": 78,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "You could be quite annoying sometimes—but I suppose there's blame to share. Had I not met you, I wouldn't be standing here, safe and sound."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 79,
        "ActionId": 79,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "So, thank you... and I'm sorry... I never told you my story."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "\"Spring will return... Your favorite flowers will bloom again...\" Only when you told me that did I realize..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "...I never got to tell you how I got the pear blossoms in my books."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "We were always hiding our past, so we could only talk about the books we loved."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 83,
        "ActionId": 83,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "You might have become a merchant for the Forsaken like I did if you had survived. Who knows? Maybe eventually we could be honest with each other... and become real friends."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 84,
        "ActionId": 84,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "...It's too late for any of that, isn't it?"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 85,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "Mom, Captain Rachel, Field, Shauna, Niino, Weyland, Ed, Aunt Hill... Everyone I cared for on the train is gone..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 86,
        "ActionId": 86,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Red Tide Projection",
            "...Will you go back to Asslam?"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 87,
        "ActionId": 87,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The phantom keeps repeating Bella's words at random. The young man is not bothered and instead starts chatting with the familiar voice."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 88,
        "ActionId": 88,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "There's no reason to return anymore."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 89,
        "ActionId": 89,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "I ran into Mike at a Forsaken base a few months ago. He told me Niino had passed too."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 90,
        "ActionId": 90,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Shrek",
            "He said..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 91,
        "ActionId": 91,
        "Type": 501,
        "Params": [
            "Assets/Product/Effect/Prefab/FxUi/FxUiStoryNew/FxUiStoryWhiteNew.prefab",
